WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.540
Good morning Hank, it's Monday. I'm wearing a suit made out of signatures but I can't remember why;

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.320
please ignore my crazy eyes, they're crazy! Mmmmm, crazy...

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:14.280
I wanna thank everybody for participating in signing psychosis, because I know my fashion sense is gettting

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:20.520
worse and worse as I get crazier and crazier with the signatures, but your fashion sense is also getting worse,

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:25.580
Nerdfighteria, and that makes me feel better. Sometimes I just like to rub my signatures. Do you think it could be

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:32.100
the Sharpie chemicals? Maybe they're making me, you know... crazy. Am I crazy? Or am I the sanest person in

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:35.920
the room? I'm the only person in the room. Hold on, Hank, I have to acquire another person to test my sanity.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:41.520
Willie, are you a dog or a man? There's no such thing as a mog, which are you?! Hank, I realize I must free myself

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:45.600
from the tyranny of these signatures! *Angelic singing* Movie Magic! Hank, as you know, I'm under a lot of

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:55.300
stress right now, mostly because of the TFIOS signing; let's go to the TFIOS-ometer. OW! DOHH! Ohhh, I've

00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:02.940
made a mistake! It's not as wheely as I thought it was gonna be. So Hank, as you can see, I only have 25,000

00:01:02.940 --> 00:01:08.760
copies left to sign, but a) 25,000 is a lot of copies and b) I don't have many non-travel days left in which to sign

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:13.640
those books, so I'm sort of freaking out right now. Hank, I wanna quickly thank Nerdfighteria again for giving me

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:20.020
the world's first-est first-world problem. I signed 5300 books yesterday, it took me about 14 hours, I'm going to

00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:25.400
have to keep that pace going on every non-travel day between now and November third in order to finish,

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:30.440
I hope that I finish, because otherwise some of you will get unsigned books and you will be very mad at me, and

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:41.660
I will be mad at myself, there will be a lot of anger in the room. *takes a deep breath loudly* Sometimes when I

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:46.520
feel a lot of anxiety, i just want to, like, sound my barbaric yop over the rooftops of the world, like

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:59.420
YOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOP!

00:01:59.420 --> 00:02:02.860
Somebody got me a zombie unicorn hat, Hank, wasn't that nice? Alright Hank, we are now at Holiday Park and

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:07.340
people are looking at me funny but I don't know why, I'm just a man in a suit with a zombie unicorn hat filming

00:02:07.340 --> 00:02:11.460
himself. What else do you expect to see in a public park on a Monday morning? Ok, Hank, I need Nerdfighteria's

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:16.500
help. Nerdfighters, you have uncovered the story of Ivan the Terrible's terrible library, you have found the truth

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:22.340
about Gussie Manlove, and now I need you to explain to me... the ruins. So, there are these weird, fake ruins in

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:26.620
the middle of a public park here in Indianapolis, but they've kind of become real ruins due to decades of

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:30.300
neglect. So I'm hoping that by using the combined research powers of Nerfighteria, we can figure out,

00:02:30.300 --> 00:02:34.000
y'know, what the heck. Hank, this would, of course, would be a great time to use Your Pants, but

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:39.100
unfortunately, Your Pants are still broken, sentences that don't make sense out of context. So, uh, we can use a

00:02:39.100 --> 00:02:44.160
forum at the Ning or YouTube comments here, but I'm hoping that you guys can just help me figure out...

00:02:44.160 --> 00:02:49.840
what is this strange and terrible beauty behind me? Hank, I'm gonna go back to signing, but I will see you on

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:55.540
Wednesday. PS: Nerdfighters, I will be reading from The Fault in Our Stars in Indianapolis on November first, then

00:02:55.540 --> 00:03:00.700
I will also be at the final Beckoning of Lovely event at the Bean in Chicago, on November 11th;

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.700
more info in the dooblydoo.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.040
P.P.S: Hank I know we're throwing words around like 'crazy' and 'psychosis',

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:06.900
and I also know lots of nerdfighters including this one, *points to self*

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.160
have struggled with or are struggling with mental illness.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.620
So, anyway I don't want to make fun of mental illness, I want to make fun of me.

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:15.960
Alright, thats all, see you tomorrow... Wednesday. Gah, I'm so bad at days!

